msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a "
"gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Aholkua: ireki Glimpse berehala keinu batekin.\n"
"\n"
"Ezarri bat Ezarpenak → Ukituak eta keinuak → Keinu-kudeatzailea → aukeratu "
"keinu bat → Irakurgailua → 'Ireki Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(Aholku hau behin bakarrik erakusten da.)"

msgid "Mode: Show all images"
msgstr "Modua: Erakutsi irudi guztiak"

msgid "Mode: Show images up to current chapter"
msgstr "Modua: Erakutsi irudiak uneko kapituluraino"

msgid "Show images up to current chapter"
msgstr "Erakutsi irudiak uneko kapituluraino"

msgid ""
"Images that appear beyond your current position stay hidden, so you can't "
"spoil yourself. Granularity is per chapter: images in the chapter you are "
"currently reading are shown."
msgstr ""
"Zure uneko posiziotik harago agertzen diren irudiak ezkutatuta geratzen "
"dira, zeure buruari spoilerrik ez egiteko. Xehetasuna kapituluka da: "
"irakurtzen ari zaren kapituluko irudiak erakusten dira."

msgid "Show all images"
msgstr "Erakutsi irudi guztiak"

msgid ""
"Show reference images from anywhere in the book, including parts you haven't "
"reached yet."
msgstr ""
"Erakutsi erreferentzia-irudiak liburuko edozein zatitatik, oraindik iritsi "
"ez zaren zatietatik ere."

